    <h1 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:46px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.06;letter-spacing:-0.03em;margin:0 0 18px;max-width:740px;text-wrap:balance;">System in Package (SiP)</h1>
    <p style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:18px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55;max-width:660px;margin:0 0 32px;text-wrap:pretty;">Multiple die, passives and interconnect integrated into one package, combining wire bond, flip chip and surface mount to create a compact subsystem that can be assembled and tested as a single component.</p>
